    "tags": [],
    "description": {
      "value": "<p><strong>Tier 4 — Prophet / Oracle</strong></p><p><strong>“The campaign is already telling you what it wants. I just hear it louder.”</strong></p><p>At Tier 4, prophecy becomes campaign-facing. You are no longer reacting to immediate danger alone. You can perceive approaching pattern at the level of factions, arcs, and emerging catastrophe.</p><p><strong>Strategic (Campaign / Faction Scale)</strong></p><ul><li>Once per Strategic Turn, ask the GM one major foresight question about an impending threat, faction move, campaign complication, or likely point of fracture</li><li>The answer should be truthful, though it may be symbolic, partial, or framed as pressure rather than exposition</li><li>Additionally, once per Scenario, your faction may treat one future-facing preparation action as if it had unusually accurate intelligence behind it</li></ul><p><strong>Cost:</strong> large-scale prophecy is never clean. Expect doom-bias, enemy counter-divination, omen bleed, or narrative consequences that punish overconfidence in what was seen.</p><div data-ft-per-use=\"1\" data-ft-per-use-key=\"prophT4\" style=\"margin-top:0.7rem;padding:0.55rem 0.75rem;border:1px solid #b08acc;border-radius:0.35rem;background:rgba(70,55,95,0.18);\">\n  <div style=\"font-size:0.78rem;letter-spacing:0.04em;text-transform:uppercase;color:#d4b8e8;margin-bottom:0.25rem\">⟁ Per-Use Ability — <strong>Major Foresight</strong></div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:0.86rem;opacity:0.92;line-height:1.4\"><strong>Recovery:</strong> 1/Strategic Turn &nbsp;·&nbsp; <strong>Action:</strong> Strategic &nbsp;·&nbsp; <strong>Use:</strong> Click this feature on your sheet to invoke.</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:0.82rem;opacity:0.85;margin-top:0.3rem\">Ask GM one major foresight question about an impending threat / faction move / fracture point. (Tier 4 also has a 1/Scenario unusually-accurate prep — separate.)</div>\n</div>",
      "chat": ""
    },
